# Database migrations

Full reference: [`.agents/rules/database-migrations.md`](../../.agents/rules/database-migrations.md).

- **Never** manually edit or add files under `prisma/migrations/`.
- Update `prisma/schema.prisma`, then run **`pnpm db:make -- <name>`** (autogenerate revision).
- Deploy applied migrations: **`pnpm db:migrate`** (`prisma migrate deploy`).
- No `prisma db push` for committed schema.
